Root cause:
The bug was caused by the failure to properly recognize track groups associated with track hubs, leading to tracks being assigned to unrecognized groups. This issue arose from a previous change that did not account for groups prefixed with "hub_", resulting in erroneous behavior when processing tracks that belong to track hubs.

